Not in this repository
----------------------

- Model weights. The v1 weights are not in this repository or in the code packages, and the
  Apache License does not cover them. They are distributed separately as the asset
  glypharis-v1.tar.gz of the GitHub release v1.0, under CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution to
  HierText and Open Images; LICENSE-WEIGHTS and NOTICE.md in the archive give the licence and
  the attribution. The detector was initialised from ImageNet-1K weights, whose terms do not
  clearly allow commercial use, and is kept as a disclosed exception
  (docs/decisions/ADR-0014-weights-and-backbone-terms.md, "Phase 23 outcome"). The weights are
  not described as cleared for commercial use.
- Datasets, the official evaluators, fonts and the GDC-scan document are not in the repository.
  Their sources and terms are recorded in DATASETS.md.
- glypharis/sample/page.png is set in Open Sans (SIL OFL 1.1); the font file is not included.

DATASETS.md, MODEL_CARD.md and ADR-0014 record what the publishers state and how the project
handled it. They are not legal advice.
